<title>SINGAPORE: New chairmen for Keppel FELS, Keppel T&amp;T.</title>
<headline>New chairmen for Keppel FELS, Keppel T&amp;T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Corporation said on Tuesday new chairmen had been appointed at Keppel FELS and Keppel Telecommunications and Transport Ltd (Keppel T&amp;T).</p>
<p>It said in a statement Choo Chiau Beng stepped up from deputy chairman to take over at Keppel FELS, replacing Loh Wing Siew, managing director at Keppel Corporation.</p>
<p>Teo Soon Hoe, who has been acting chairman of Keppel T&amp;T since previous chairman Neville Watson died in April 1996, had been confirmed in the post, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
